<title>USA: Patriot American Q1 diluted shr up slightly.</title>
<headline>Patriot American Q1 diluted shr up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31,</p>
<p>			    1997			 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.25		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			 11,348		    7,128</p>
<p> Revs			36,409		   13,826</p>
<p> Avg Shrs		  44,552		   29,468</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
